              新增诊断仍保持 journal sink，不作为 checkpoint blocker
              </?01M05F1PG4SPFYG8YSFZTP28GS>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T6.3" name = "复现 checkpoint 取样后 effect evidence 漂移" status = "DONE" order = 2 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PG4SPFYG8YSFZTP28GT>
            在 composer/engine 测试中模拟 checkpoint writer 期间 effect evidence 追加，证明旧实现会提交 evidence-ahead-of-snapshot 的 authoritative marker。
            </?01M05F1PG4SPFYG8YSFZTP28GT>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #AC-effect-drift-repro-test { checked = true } ?01M05F1PG4SPFYG8YSFZTP28GV>
              测试覆盖 writer 窗口追加 effect evidence
              </?01M05F1PG4SPFYG8YSFZTP28GV>
              <Criterion #AC-drift-not-treated-as-session-repair { checked = true } ?01M05F1PG4SPFYG8YSFZTP28GW>
              测试场景描述为运行中写出问题，而非历史 session 清理问题
              </?01M05F1PG4SPFYG8YSFZTP28GW>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T6.4" name = "从 runtime-control engine 层用 WAL cursor 定义 checkpoint cut" status = "DONE" order = 3 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PG4SPFYG8YSFZTP28GX>
            checkpoint prepare 记录 effect WAL logical cursor；writer-window 内追加的 LLM/tool evidence 留作 WAL tail，不纳入本次 checkpoint prefix，也不触发 drift guard。
            </?01M05F1PG4SPFYG8YSFZTP28GX>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #AC-drift-is-wal-tail { checked = true } ?01M05F1PG4SPFYG8YSFZTP28GY>
              writer 窗口 effect evidence 追加时 checkpoint marker 仍提交，但 effectEvidenceSequence 保持 prepare cursor
              </?01M05F1PG4SPFYG8YSFZTP28GY>
              <Criterion #AC-stable-checkpoint-still-commits { checked = true } ?01M05F1PG4SPFYG8YSFZTP28GZ>
              无漂移时 checkpoint 正常提交且现有 recovery 测试通过
              </?01M05F1PG4SPFYG8YSFZTP28GZ>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
        <Hooks [
          <Hook { on = "phase:after" } (
            <GapLoop { max_rounds = 5 on_exhausted = "block" }>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    ]>
  )>
  <Schedule>
)>
